{
    "version": "0.7.4",
    "description": "Rust端的Frp客户端/服务端 兼容Go版本的原版Frp",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/Nu0vo1212/Rust-Frp",
    "license": "Apache-2.0",
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/Nu0vo1212/Rust-Frp"
    },
    "url": "https://github.com/Nu0vo1212/Rust-Frp/releases/download/v0.7.4/nfrp-windows-amd64.zip",
    "hash": "sha256:1ee2609152f770cf5502ebc7c82c851e59021b971ec3f0b24575534cb5d259e0",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/Nu0vo1212/Rust-Frp/releases/download/v$version/nfrp-windows-amd64.zip"
    },
    "persist": "client.toml",
    "pre_install": [
        "if (!(Test-Path \"$persist_dir\\client.toml\")) { & \"$dir\\frpc.exe\" --gen-config \"$dir\\client.toml\" | Out-Null }"
    ],
    "bin": [
        [
            "frpc.exe",
            "rustfrpc"
        ]
    ],
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "frpc.exe",
            "rustfrp"
        ]
    ],
    "notes": [
        "安装时自动执行 frpc --gen-config 生成独立的 client.toml，并 persist 到 D:\\scoop\\persist\\rustfrp\\client.toml；与 frp 的配置完全独立，不共用。",
        "首次安装后请编辑 client.toml（serverAddr / serverPort / auth / proxies）；运行：rustfrpc -c D:\\scoop\\persist\\rustfrp\\client.toml。",
        "shim 名使用 rustfrpc.exe，避免与 frp 包的 frpc 冲突。"
    ]
}